message: "If you use this work, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "GNN_Uncertainty"
abstract: "Graph neural network that predicts the coercivity of hard magnetic microstructures with aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty estimates (Gaussian negative log-likelihood loss and Monte Carlo dropout). Code and data for the graph-neural-network study of the article 'Modelling magnetic material properties with uncertainty-aware neural networks'."
repository-code: "https://github.com/heisammoustafa/GNN_Uncertainty"
